WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Case 3: quantity changes from a number to text, like "6 units". (Re-run recorded after the fact.)

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Step 1: upload the case 3 file to S3 as input/orders.csv.

00:09.000 --> 00:16.000
Step 2: run the same pipeline. (The red boxes are left over from the last case.)

00:16.000 --> 00:22.000
"Pipeline completed successfully." No error, no warning, so there's no Ask Chatbot button either.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000
But look at the cleaned data: the quantity column is tagged Categorical (text), not Numeric.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
And the values still say "6 units", "3 units". Any total or average of quantity would break downstream.

00:32.000 --> 00:39.000
Step 3: Google Cloud Storage. The new file is there, delivered as a success with text in a number column.
